abstract: >-
  Genetic-algorithm search for dynamical dark-energy equations of state w(a)
  using CLASS, Cobaya, and CLiENT, with DIC fitness and posterior-constraint
  gates on Pantheon+SH0ES + DESI DR2 data.
keywords:
  - cosmology
  - dark energy
  - genetic algorithm
  - CLASS
  - Cobaya
  - CLiENT
